## Email us

Email **hello@juniperhealth.app**. We aim to reply within **5 working days**.

## What we can help with

- mistakes or out of date information on our website
- problems using our website or self-checks
- ideas for new guides or health conditions
- complaints (see our [complaints page](/complaints/))
- questions about your privacy

## What we cannot help with

We are a small team, so we cannot give one to one advice about your own benefit claim or your health. For free, independent, one to one help, contact:

- **Citizens Advice:** citizensadvice.org.uk, or call Adviceline on 0800 144 8848 (England) or 0800 702 2020 (Wales)
- **your council's welfare rights service**
- **Turn2us:** turn2us.org.uk, for a benefits calculator and grants search
- **Age UK:** 0800 678 1602, for people over State Pension age
- **Contact:** 0808 808 3555, for families with disabled children

For health questions, speak to your **GP**, a **pharmacist**, or call **NHS 111**.

{% callout type="warn" title="Please keep health details to a minimum" %}
You do not need to tell us about your health to contact us. If you do, we will only use it to reply to you. Read our [privacy policy](/privacy-policy/).
{% /callout %}

